msgid "%1$s alone is holding %2$s of free space inside its own file. Optimising rewrites the table and returns it to the disk."
msgstr "%1$s ensam håller %2$s ledigt utrymme i sin egen fil. Optimering skriver om tabellen och lämnar tillbaka det till disken."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1873
msgid "No table is holding a significant amount of reclaimable space."
msgstr "Ingen tabell håller en betydande mängd återvinningsbart utrymme."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1875
msgid "Optimise tables"
msgstr "Optimera tabeller"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1877
msgid "Back up first. Optimising locks each table while it runs."
msgstr "Säkerhetskopiera först. Optimering låser varje tabell medan den körs."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1895
msgid "Post meta lookup index"
msgstr "Uppslagsindex för inläggsmeta"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1898
msgid "Present"
msgstr "Finns"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1900
msgid "A combined post_id and meta_key index is present, so meta lookups stay fast."
msgstr "Ett kombinerat post_id- och meta_key-index finns, så metauppslagningar förblir snabba."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1901
msgid "Lookups by post and meta key fall back to two separate indexes. On sites with heavy meta use (WooCommerce, event and booking plugins) a combined index is a large, low-risk speed win."
msgstr "Uppslagningar på inlägg och metanyckel faller tillbaka på två separata index. På webbplatser med tung metaanvändning (WooCommerce, evenemangs- och bokningstillägg) är ett kombinerat index en stor, låg-risk vinst."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1903
msgid "Add the index"
msgstr "Lägg till indexet"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1905
msgid "Back up first. Adding an index locks the table briefly."
msgstr "Säkerhetskopiera först. Att lägga till ett index låser tabellen kort."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1949
msgid "Auto-increment headroom"
msgstr "Auto-increment-utrymme"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1951
msgid "Healthy"
msgstr "Friskt"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of database table names.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1956
msgid "These tables are within 20 percent of the largest id their column type can store. Once the ceiling is reached, new rows stop being written: %s"
msgstr "De här tabellerna är inom 20 procent av det största id deras kolumntyp kan lagra. När taket nås slutar nya rader att skrivas: %s"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1959
msgid "No table is close to exhausting its id column."
msgstr "Ingen tabell är nära att tömma sin id-kolumn."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1967
msgid "Orphaned post meta"
msgstr "Föräldralös inläggsmeta"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1970
msgid "These meta rows belong to posts that no longer exist. They are dead weight in every query that touches post meta."
msgstr "De här metaraderna tillhör inlägg som inte längre finns. De är död vikt i varje fråga som rör inläggsmeta."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1971
msgid "Every meta row belongs to a post that still exists."
msgstr "Varje metarad tillhör ett inlägg som fortfarande finns."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1973
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1991
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2009
msgid "Delete them"
msgstr "Ta bort dem"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1975
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1993
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2011
msgid "Back up first. This permanently deletes rows."
msgstr "Säkerhetskopiera först. Detta tar bort rader permanent."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1985
msgid "Orphaned user meta"
msgstr "Föräldralös användarmeta"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1988
msgid "These meta rows belong to users who no longer exist, usually left behind by a plugin that removed accounts directly."
msgstr "De här metaraderna tillhör användare som inte längre finns, oftast kvarlämnade av ett tillägg som tog bort konton direkt."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1989
msgid "Every meta row belongs to a user who still exists."
msgstr "Varje metarad tillhör en användare som fortfarande finns."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2003
msgid "Orphaned term relationships"
msgstr "Föräldralösa termrelationer"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2006
msgid "These rows link content to categories or tags that no longer exist."
msgstr "De här raderna kopplar innehåll till kategorier eller etiketter som inte längre finns."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2007
msgid "Every relationship points at a term that still exists."
msgstr "Varje relation pekar på en term som fortfarande finns."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2021
msgid "Stored revisions"
msgstr "Lagrade versioner"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2024
msgid "Revisions are the editor safety net, so a large number is normal and not a fault. Trimming them is only worthwhile if the posts table has grown unwieldy."
msgstr "Versioner är redigerarens skyddsnät, så ett stort antal är normalt och inte ett fel. Att beskära dem lönar sig bara om inläggstabellen har blivit ohanterlig."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2025
msgid "No revisions are stored."
msgstr "Inga versioner är lagrade."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2027
msgid "Delete all revisions"
msgstr "Ta bort alla versioner"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2029
msgid "Back up first. This removes every saved revision permanently."
msgstr "Säkerhetskopiera först. Detta tar bort varje sparad version permanent."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2039
msgid "Spam and trashed comments"
msgstr "Skräppost och kommentarer i papperskorgen"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2042
msgid "Spam and trashed comments stay in the database until they are emptied. WordPress clears them on its own after a while."
msgstr "Skräppost och kommentarer i papperskorgen stannar i databasen tills de töms. WordPress rensar dem själv efter ett tag."

